{"id":"ausgabe","lemma":"Ausgabe","pos":"noun","rank":4489,"glosses":["edition, issue (literary work)","version, copy (of a book or booklet)","expenditure, spending, expense"],"ipa":"/ˈaʊ̯sˌɡaːbə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/57/De-Ausgabe.ogg/De-Ausgabe.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Ausgabe","plural":"Ausgaben"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich habe viele Ausgaben.","en":"I have a lot of expenses.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},null]},{"text":"Es ist meine einzige Ausgabe.","en":"It's my only copy.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"only, sole","l":"einzig"},null]},{"text":"Wann kommt die nächste Ausgabe des Magazins heraus?","en":"When does the next issue of the magazine come out?","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"near","l":"nah"},null,{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"magazine","l":"Magazin"},{"g":"out of"}]},{"text":"Wir müssen unsere Ausgaben kürzen.","en":"We must cut down our expenses.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have to"},{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null,{"g":"to shorten"}]},{"text":"Sie versuchte, ihre Ausgaben zu senken.","en":"She tried to lower her expenses.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"versuchen"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to lower"}]}]}